{"title":"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Alternate_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the length of a rectangle is increased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> and its width is increased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/7/9f7f4de02215a8c5319886c13b2e291811346e1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />, then the area is increased by \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/8/398636d96c8e7b65b8807209d7487bd6a8f8d37e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 10\\% \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 30\\% \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 70\\% \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 80\\% \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 100\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"460\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If a rectangle had dimensions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/6/d16d7291c4d1e63c615aef900231fbf5ce75b235.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 \\times 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> and area <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, then its new dimensions would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/9/f59783eb17261ce51f89af3350a36525288aeef9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12 \\times 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> and area <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/b/5cb1b41850ab676e4d1cf15c69b1609af4befbc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />. The area is increased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/3/e23c92af330136c331251de5bc9967882b7789c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180-100=80$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"118\" height=\"13\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/b/d4b22f503830f233d4cdb9c32d8f0ff1b5bed084.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80/100 = \\boxed{\\text{(D)}\\ 80\\%}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"155\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_Solution\">Alternate Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Alternate Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the dimensions of the rectangle be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/d/4ed19bd4c2e8cfa44630b3ae0d841787fd8089ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\times y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />. This rectangle has area <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/7/3f79c3676b62fb47243e0d357c87115b6f3395e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"13\" />. The new dimensions would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/8/a987cf91786e954c195bd3feeef2fb918bf10260.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.2x \\times 1.5y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"90\" height=\"17\" />, so the area is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/1/8517cfa47d6c7063b029da3780b9e0a004dc8649.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=1.8xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/f/f7fd60484cca5709fc50a66c6ae601d607279d5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{80\\%}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"45\" height=\"26\" /> more than the original area.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME\" title=\"1993 AJHSME\">1993 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1993\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\"